        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-04, Traditional 4 Inch Beaded Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith plenty of finishes to choose from, the Beaded Cabinet Pull is a great way to add classic beauty to any home. Suitable for use on cabinet doors, on furniture, or even on accordion-style doors. It comes packaged with screws for easy installation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-04 Decorative Curved Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>RKI-CP-04:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CP-05:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNeed this pull in a different size? See the <a href=\"/products/traditional-4-inch-cabinet-handle-deltana-pct400\"><b>4 inch Beaded Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
